 t Morpheus\, an elusive figure considered to be the most dangerous man al
 ive\, can answer his question -- What is the Matrix? Neo is contacted by 
 Trinity\, a beautiful stranger who leads him into an underworld where he 
 meets Morpheus. They fight a brutal battle for their lives against a cadr
 e of viciously intelligent secret agents. It is a truth that could cost N
 eo something more precious than his life." - Rotten Tomatoes\n \n"The me
 taphorical properties of The Matrix are part of what makes it so seductiv
 e\, along with the no-filler-all-killer action."-Peter Bradshaw of the Gu
 ardian\n\n \n \nWatch the trailer here:  https://www.youtube.com/watch
 ?v=ywmaUcIH30w \n \n\n \nFor information on available assistive conten
 t for WUD Film screenings\, please visit the Assistive Movie Screenings i
 n the Marquee Theater page.  \nVisit our Informed Moviegoing Resources 
 page for links to resources that explore film ratings and content alerts.
